	(text_box "Power comes in from the battery connector or the LinkE header, whichever is plugged. Both at once is fine, the SS54s OR them into VSYS and the loser just sits behind its diode.\n\nInputs:\n- VBAT - bench 5V up to 2S LiPo (DRV VM tops out at 11V, so no 3S)\n- VPROG - 5V from the WCH-LinkE\n\nRails:\n- VSYS - raw motor rail, also feeds the LDO\n- +3V3 - logic\n\nLEDs are deliberately dim (0.1-0.3mA class). Yellow = VSYS, green = 3V3. STAT over on the MCU sheet is the only one allowed to yell."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 180.34 27.94 0)
		(size 101.6 135.255)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.75 1.75)
				(thickness 0.1588)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "22166f32-6dd8-4a36-b2a0-c826048fcf51")
	)
